That receiver owns the real Arc<Origin>, is retained from the original KernelPacket,
and performs the same sender/time/boot/namespace validation with sticky refusal.
OriginalManagerJoin consumes a ten-lifetime OriginalEnrollmentFrame and reaches
the receiver through the real preparation/Starting/pipes/outputs/material chain.
A small shadow frame would not prove this compatibility.

The fixture copies all **545 original src Rust files**, the complete tracked
